From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandeep Gundlupet Raju <sandeep.gundlupet-raju@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gstgldisplay_egl: define EGL_PLATFORM_SURFACELESS_MESA if
 missing

EGL_PLATFORM_SURFACELESS_MESA (0x31DD) is defined in Mesa's
eglmesaext.h which is not installed when using non-Mesa EGL
implementations such as libmali-xlnx. The code that references this
symbol is already guarded by a runtime extension string check
(gst_gl_check_extension("EGL_MESA_platform_surfaceless", ...)), but
the compile-time symbol is missing.

Add a conditional #ifndef guard to provide the standard value when the
symbol is not already defined by the EGL headers.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [libmali-xlnx does not install eglmesaext.h; not applicable upstream]

AI-Generated: GitHub Copilot (Claude Sonnet 4.6)

Signed-off-by: Sandeep Gundlupet Raju <sandeep.gundlupet-raju@amd.com>
---
 gst-libs/gst/gl/egl/gstgldisplay_egl.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/gst-libs/gst/gl/egl/gstgldisplay_egl.c b/gst-libs/gst/gl/egl/gstgldisplay_egl.c
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/gst-libs/gst/gl/egl/gstgldisplay_egl.c
+++ b/gst-libs/gst/gl/egl/gstgldisplay_egl.c
@@ -62,6 +62,9 @@
 #ifndef EGL_PLATFORM_ANGLE_ANGLE
 #define EGL_PLATFORM_ANGLE_ANGLE 0x3202
 #endif
+#ifndef EGL_PLATFORM_SURFACELESS_MESA
+#define EGL_PLATFORM_SURFACELESS_MESA 0x31DD
+#endif
 
 typedef EGLDisplay (*_gst_eglGetPlatformDisplay_type) (EGLenum platform,
     void *native_display, const EGLint * attrib_list);
